# Keep the repository content in LF and let Git check out the platform's
# preferred line endings. Shell scripts must stay LF so they remain runnable
# on Unix-like hosts; Windows batch files use CRLF.
* text=auto

*.bat text eol=crlf
gradlew text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf

*.jar binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
